            "body": "This release contains changes for datasets:\n\n- Newcastle disease virus class 2 (nextstrain/ndv/class-2/NC_075404)\n- Newcastle disease virus class 1 (nextstrain/ndv/class-1/AB524405)\n\n\n\n## Newcastle disease virus class 2 (nextstrain/ndv/class-2/NC_075404)\n\n - initial release of the draft NDV class 2 dataset\n - the class 1 reference AB524405 is included in the reference tree as an outgroup, so that class 1 sequences attach to it and are reported as `class 1` instead of being placed inside the class 2 diversity\n\n\n## Newcastle disease virus class 1 (nextstrain/ndv/class-1/AB524405)\n\n - initial release of the draft NDV class 1 dataset\n - the class 2 reference NC_075404 is included in the reference tree as an outgroup, so that class 2 sequences attach to it and are reported as `class 2` instead of being placed inside the class 1 diversity\n\n"
